{"id":"34e58e195eb37fee","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SRelDomains.md","title":"SRelDomains","display":"SRelDomains","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SRelDomains","parameters":["D","K"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SRelDomains"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>K</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：二阶语法与语义。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>K</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SRelDomains D K)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists w\n  (and\n    (@ Omega w)\n    (and\n      (@ FunDom K w)\n      (forall n\n        (implies\n          (in n w)\n          (exists T\n            (exists P\n              (exists H\n                (and (@ FTuples D n T) (and (@ Power T P) (and (@ App K n H) (and (@ Nonempty H) (@ Subset H P)))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"879692e175100c7e\" href=\"?note=879692e175100c7e\" title=\"ZFC_FTuples\">FTuples</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2fa14e4bd3447c97\" href=\"?note=2fa14e4bd3447c97\" title=\"ZFC_FunDom\">FunDom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fe68ff8d3284eeda\" href=\"?note=fe68ff8d3284eeda\" title=\"ZFC_Nonempty\">Nonempty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d77373a330f372f\" href=\"?note=5d77373a330f372f\" title=\"ZFC_Power\">Power</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5b37d2d8ba4703a7\" href=\"?note=5b37d2d8ba4703a7\" title=\"ZFC_Subset\">Subset</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ SRelDomains D K)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTuples|FTuples]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_Power|Power]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FTuples","status":"resolved","id":"879692e175100c7e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTuples|FTuples]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_Power|Power]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FunDom","status":"resolved","id":"2fa14e4bd3447c97","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTuples|FTuples]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_Power|Power]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nonempty","status":"resolved","id":"fe68ff8d3284eeda","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文